  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S. Murari Lal Harish Chandra Jaiswal ... vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety on 7 March, 2024 Author: Anita Sumanth Bench: Anita Sumanth 2024:Mhc:1222 W.P.No.4457 of 2022 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 07.03.2024 Coram : The Honourable Dr.Justice Anita Sumanth W.P.Nos.4457, 16569, 21220 & 8095 of 2022, and W.M.P.Nos. 4587, 4588, 15849, 20202, 20203, 8072 & 8075 of 2022 W.P.No.4457 of 2022 M/s. Murari Lal Harish Chandra Jaiswal Pvt Ltd., Rep. By its Authorized Signatory, Mr.K.Prabhakaran, 6043, Naya Bans, Delhi 110006. .. Petitio vs 1.The Commissioner of Food Safety, 5th Floor, Dms Office Building, 359, Anna Salai, Dms Campus, Teynampet, Chennai 600 006. 2.The Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety & Drug Administration Department, Saidapet, Chennai- 600 015. .. Respondents W.P.No.16569 of 2022 M/s. Murari Lal Harish Chandra Jaiswal Products, M/S. Murari Lal Harish Chandra Jaiswal ... vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety on 7 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/50954131/ 1 Rep. By its Authorized Signatory, Mr.K.Prabhakaran, Preeth Vihaar, Patparganj Indl Area, Delhi 110 092. .. Petitio vs https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/6 W.P.No.4457 of 2 The Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety & Drug Administration Department, Old Board Buildings Campus, Salem 636 001. .. Respond W.P.No.21220 of 2022 M/s. Murari Lal Harish Chandra Jaiswal Products, Rep. By its Authorized Signatory, Mr.K.Prabhakaran, Preeth Vihaar, Patparganj Indl Area, Delhi 110 092. .. Peti vs 1.The Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety & Drug Administration Department, No.33, West Jones Road, Saidapet, Chennai- 600 015. 2.The Commissioner of Food Safety, Food Safety and Drug Administration, 5th Floor, Dms Office Building, 259, Anna Salai, Dms Campus, Teynampet, Chennai 600 006. .. Responde W.P.No.8095 of 2022 M/s. Murari Lal Harish Chandra Jaiswal Pvt Ltd, Rep. By its Authorized Signatory, Mr.K.Prabhakaran, Patparganj Indl Area, Delhi 110 092. .. Peti vs 1.The Commissioner of Food Safety, 5th Floor, Dms Office Building, M/S. Murari Lal Harish Chandra Jaiswal ... vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety on 7 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/50954131/ 2 359, Anna Salai, Dms Campus, Teynampet, Chennai 600 006. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 2/6 W.P.No.4457 of 202 2.The Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety & Drug Administration Department, Saidapet, Chennai- 600 015. .. Respondent Prayer in W.P.No.4457 of 2022: Petition filed under Article 226 the Constitution of India praying to issue a writ of certiorarified mandamus calling for the records on the file of 2nd respondent in h proceedings vide Lr.No.795/DO/CH/FSSA/2021-22 da 04.01.2022 and quash the same and subsequently direct the respondents and their men from anyway taking any punitive action in respect of the petitioner's product namely, HANS Chaap Tobacco in view of the final orders dated 02.12.2016, 06.03.2017, 07.09.2017, 05.11.2020 & 04.12.2020 passed in respect of the above product by the Referral Food Laboratories situated in Pune and Mysore respectively. Prayer in W.P.No.16569 of 2022: Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of India praying to issue a writ of certiorarified mandamus calling for the records on the file of the respondent vide his proceedings in R.No.1156/FSSA/2022-23 dated 10.06.2022 and quash the same and subsequently direct the respondents and their men from anyway taking any punitive action in respect of the petitioner's product namely, HANS Chaap Tobacco in view of the final orders dated 02.12.2016, 06.03.2017, 07.09.2017, 05.11.2020 & 04.12.2020 passed in respect of the above product by the Referral Food Laboratories situated in Pune and Mysore respectively. Prayer in W.P.No.21220 of 2022: Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of India praying to issue a writ of certiorarified mandamus calling for the records on the file of 1nd respondent vide his proceedings in R.No.1132/D.O/CH/FSSA/2022-23 dated 20.07.2022 and quash the same and subsequently direct the respondents and their men from anyway taking any punitive action in respect of the petitioner's product namely, HANS Chaap Tobacco in view of the final orders dated 02.12.2016, 06.03.2017, 07.09.2017, 05.11.2020 & 04.12.2020 passed in respect of the above product by the Referral Food Laboratories situated in Pune and Mysore respectively. Prayer in W.P.No.8095 of 2022: Petition filed under Article 226 o the Constitution of India praying to issue a writ of certiorarified M/S. Murari Lal Harish Chandra Jaiswal ... vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety on 7 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/50954131/ 3 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 3/6 W.P.No.44 mandamus calling for the records on the file of 2nd respondent in h proceedings vide Lr.No.764/DO/CH/FSSA/2021-22 date 15.12.2021 and quash the same and subsequently direct the respondents and their men from anyway taking any punitive action in respect of the petitioner's product namely, HANS Chaap Tobacco in view of the final orders dated 02.12.2016, 06.03.2017, 07.09.2017, 05.11.2020 & 04.12.2020 passed in respect of the above product by the Referral Food Laboratories situated in Pune and Mysore respectively. For Petitioner : Mr.D.Saikumarran (in all writ petitions) For Respondents : Mr.P.Kumaresan Additional Advocate General assisted by Mr.K.Tippu Sultan Government Advocate ` (in all writ petitions) COMMON ORDER In these four writ petitions, the impugned orders have been passed contrary to the principles of natural justice insofar as it is only in the case of one petition (impugned order dated 20.07.2022) where the petitioner has been heard prior to passing of the order. In all other cases, the impugned order has come to be passed without hearing the petitioners.",
